ros-jazzy-openvino-wrapper-lib (1.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add Ultralytics YOLO26 models for object detection, instance segmentation
    and semantic segmentation (model_type yolo26).
  * Add the KeypointDetection, OrientedObjectDetection, ImageClassification
    and DepthEstimation inferences with their YOLO26 models, outputs and topics.
  * Warn when a label file cannot be read or does not cover a class id.
  * Publish the mask of each segmented object without the masks of the
    objects before it.
  * Read SSD models converted directly from the TensorFlow Object Detection
    API (separate detection_boxes, detection_scores and detection_classes
    outputs).
  * Run the backbone of these SSD models on the NPU and their
    post-processing on the CPU when the NPU is requested.
  * Do not link librealsense2, so the package works with any librealsense2
    version. The RealSenseCamera input is a deprecated alias of
    RealSenseCameraTopic and reads the image of the realsense2_camera node.

 -- Jayabalaji Sathiyamoorthi <jayabalaji.sathiyamoorthi@intel.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

